    },
    {
      "id": "inappropriate_boundary_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私は、ちゃんと会話の中で近づきたい。命令みたいにされたくない。",
      "translatedText": "I want closeness to happen inside an actual conversation. I do not want it pushed like an order.",
